---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact — Where Is Baldo?" description="Get in touch with Baldo. Partnerships, questions, or just saying hello.">

  <div class="post-header">
    <span class="post-tag">Contact</span>
    <h1>Get in Touch</h1>
    <p class="post-meta">I read everything. I respond to things that seem real.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="post-body">

    <p>Whether you want to talk about a collaboration, ask about a destination, or just say hello — here's how to reach me.</p>

    <h2>For Partnerships & Collaborations</h2>
    <p>Read the <a href="/work-with-me">Work With Me page</a> first so we're on the same page, then reach out via email with a brief description of what you're working on.</p>

    <h2>For Everything Else</h2>
    <p>Instagram DMs are the fastest way to get a response: <strong>@whereisbaldo</strong></p>

    <div class="contact-form-wrap">
      <h2>Send a Message</h2>
      <form
        name="contact"
        method="POST"
        data-netlify="true"
        action="/contact-success"
        class="contact-form"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required placeholder="Your name" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="your@email.com" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="subject">Subject</label>
          <select id="subject" name="subject">
            <option value="general">General / Just Saying Hi</option>
            <option value="collaboration">Partnership / Collaboration</option>
            <option value="destination">Question About a Destination</option>
            <option value="other">Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" required rows="6" placeholder="What's on your mind?"></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Send It →</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <h2>Social</h2>
    <p>
      Instagram: <a href="https://instagram.com/whereisbaldo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@whereisbaldo</a><br />
      TikTok: <a href="https://tiktok.com/@whereisbaldo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@whereisbaldo</a><br />
      Facebook: <a href="https://facebook.com/whereisbaldo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">whereisbaldo</a>
    </p>

  </div>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact-form-wrap {
    background: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--kraft);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 2rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
  }
  .contact-form-wrap h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .form-group label {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--brown);
  }
  .form-group input,
  .form-group select,
  .form-group textarea {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--kraft);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: white;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--dark);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .form-group input:focus,
  .form-group select:focus,
  .form-group textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--gold);
  }
  .form-group textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 140px;
  }
</style>
